B.a0_=new A.jB("3A","AC 3-Tier","3rd AC (ICF coach)","6-berth bays with side berths, fully air-conditioned.","3rd AC ICF coaches have open bays of 6 berths (lower, middle, upper) facing each other on both sides of the aisle, plus 2 side berths (side lower, side upper) along the corridor. All berths are air-conditioned with curtains or partitions for basic privacy.","ICF",64,"assets/image/3Ac_icf.png","assets/image/3Ac_icf.png")
B.a_Z=new A.jB("3A","AC 3-Tier","3rd AC (LHB coach)","Modern LHB 3-tier AC with improved ride quality.","3rd AC LHB coaches use the newer Linke Hofmann Busch design with better safety, ride comfort and higher speed potential. The internal bay pattern is similar to ICF 3A with 6-berth bays and 2 side berths, but with wider gangways and better suspension.","LHB",72,"assets/image/3Ac_lhb.png","assets/image/3Ac_lhb.png")
B.a01=new A.jB("2A","AC 2-Tier","2nd AC (ICF coach)","4-berth bays with side lower and side upper.","2nd AC ICF coaches offer 4-berth bays (lower and upper on each side) plus 2 side berths per bay. Compared to 3rd AC, there are fewer berths and more headroom, giving a more spacious and premium feel.","ICF",48,"assets/image/2AC_icf.png","assets/image/2AC_icf.png")
B.a03=new A.jB("2A","AC 2-Tier","2nd AC (LHB coach)","Modern LHB 2-tier AC with more comfort.","2nd AC LHB coaches are newer-generation coaches with improved safety, ride quality and better designed interiors. They follow the familiar 4-berth + side berth pattern with more comfort than 3rd AC.","LHB",52,"assets/image/2AC_lhb.png","assets/image/2AC_lhb.png")
B.a02=new A.jB("1A","AC First Class","1st AC (ICF coach)","Enclosed cabins and coupes with maximum privacy.","1st AC ICF coaches consist of lockable cabins and coupes with 2 or 4 berths each, offering the highest privacy level in Indian Railways. Berths are more spacious and come with bedding, curtains and dedicated luggage space.","ICF",22,"assets/image/1AC_icf.png","assets/image/1AC_icf.png")
B.a04=new A.jB("1A","AC First Class","1st AC (LHB coach)","Premium LHB first class cabins.","1st AC LHB coaches offer premium cabins and coupes in the newer LHB shell, combining privacy with better suspension, higher speed capability and improved safety compared to ICF stock.","LHB",24,"assets/image/1Ac_lhb.png","assets/image/1Ac_lhb.png")
B.a05=new A.jB("SL","Sleeper Class","Sleeper (ICF coach)","Non-AC 3-tier sleeper with open bays.","Sleeper ICF coaches are the most common non-air-conditioned coaches with open 3-tier bays and side berths. Windows are grilled with shutters, and ventilation is through fans and open windows.","ICF",72,"assets/image/SL_icf.png","assets/image/SL_icf.png")
B.a00=new A.jB("SL","Sleeper Class","Sleeper (LHB coach)","LHB sleeper with better ride and safety.","Sleeper LHB coaches use the new LHB design while retaining the popular 3-tier sleeper layout. They offer better ride comfort, improved safety features and higher permissible speeds.","LHB",80,"assets/image/sl_lhb.png","assets/image/sl_lhb.png")
